Finx — License Scope
====================

This repository is under two GPL grants, applied to different parts.

Files
-----

    COPYING     GNU General Public License, version 2 (FSF text, unmodified)
    COPYING-zh  the same licence in Chinese, an unofficial reference rendering
    LICENSE     This file: which part of the tree carries which grant
    LICENSE-zh  this file, in Chinese

GPL-2.0-only
------------

    finx-install/         installer sources, and the generated install.sh
    scripts/              repository checks and release tools
    base-files/pack.sh    payload packer
    docs/                 documentation
    LICENSE               this file

GPL-2.0-or-later
----------------

    bootstrap
    setup.sh
    install.sh
    perlmod/Fink/**
    10.9-libcxx/
    base-files/           the whole payload, including its own COPYING
    mirror/
    dpkg-checkall.sh
    inject.pl
    pre-build-test.sh
    finx-virtual-pkgs.in

Third party
-----------

    update/               autoconf / automake helper scripts
    10.9-libcxx/*.patch   patch text, following the upstream project

Reading a file header
---------------------

The grant is stated at the top of each file.

    ... either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version
        GPL-2.0-or-later

    ... version 2 of the License.
        GPL-2.0-only

Distribution
